&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Own a territory spanning across energy, manufacturing, and banking — with the majority as net new logo opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Drive the full sales cycle from prospecting through to close, managing complex, multi-stakeholder deals with AOVs of $150–200K+ and sales cycles of 6–9 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Build and execute account plans and pipeline generation strategies in collaboration with your SE, partner ecosystem, and marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain senior-level relationships (VP, Director, C-suite) across your accounts, becoming a trusted advisor on data and AI strategy&lt;/li&gt;
