&lt;p&gt;This position is based in our Tokyo office, with no remote work permitted. While business travel is generally not required, occasional accompaniment to events within Tokyo&#39;s 23 wards may be necessary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a part-time, fixed-term contract running until the end of January 2027, with expected hours of 3-4 hours per day, 4-5 days per week (up to 17 hours weekly).&lt;/p&gt;
