&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in using Microsoft Word and Excel (or Google Docs and Spreadsheets), with strong familiarity in handling data using Excel or Google Spreadsheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication Skills:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-Motivation:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
