&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Public Sector Sales Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven track record in enterprise software sales within government or public sector organisations, with a strong understanding of tender processes, procurement frameworks, and how to influence buying decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience selling complex software platforms — ideally in data, analytics, AI, machine learning, or business intelligence. Platform sales experience strongly preferred over point-solution backgrounds.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Business Hunter:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated ability to acquire new logos and drive significant net new revenue in a market where warm introductions and event presence matter more than cold outreach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value-Driven Approach:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled at understanding the unique challenges of public sector clients and articulating how Dataiku delivers tangible outcomes — including AI sovereignty, on-premise deployment capabilities, and data governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner &amp;amp; Reseller Network:&lt;/strong&gt; Established relationships within the German public sector reseller ecosystem, with the ability to leverage partners to navigate certification requirements and accelerate deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Spirit:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable working cross-functionally with pre-sales, customer success, and partner teams to move complex, multi-stakeholder deals forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Native or business-fluent German is required. Excellent English is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptability:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment and operate with an entrepreneurial mindset in a nascent market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Willingness to travel across Germany and attend relevant public sector industry events and conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
